    "northStar": "Local settings",
    "overview": "This is a descriptive record of the incumbent interface, not a new identity. Nootify uses compact neutral groups, local system typography, its existing penguin identity, and blue actions. Settings prioritize accurate connection and access states in Chinese and English.",
